= Walter Ulbricht

Walter Ulbricht is a member of the KPD's Central Committee and a skilled organizer who has earned the trust of the party and Comintern for his talents.

- @clear_agenda
- @cell_building
- @party_discipline
- @root: Return to main

@clear_agenda
title: Clear the agenda
subtitle: Removes all cards from the hand.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
if (Q.difficulty >= 0) {
    window.dendryUI.dendryEngine.state.currentHands['main'] = [];
} else {
    window.dendryUI.dendryEngine.state.currentHands['main.main_easy'] = [];
}
!}

All items from our agenda have been cleared.

@cell_building
title: Increase our street and factory cells
subtitle: Increase recruitment to the RFB.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if:advisor_action_timer == 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; international_relations_timer -= 12; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: cell_organization

@party_discipline
title: Party Discipline
subtitle: Reduce dissent across the party.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_opposition_dissent -= 5; right_opposition_dissent -= 10; marxist_leninist_dissent -= 10; conciliator_dissent -= 10; marxist_leninist_strength += 10

We have enforced party discipline to reduce dissent across all factions while strengthening the Marxist Leninists.